{"s":[[null,1,[["t",[[[["l","罐头瓶生产力","No Profession"]],[["f","Tiller.png",24]," ",["l","罐头瓶生产力 - 农耕人","Tiller"]],[["f","Artisan.png",24]," ",["l","罐头瓶生产力 - 工匠","Artisan"]]]]],["p",["This page lists the productivity of processing ",["l","水果","Fruits"],", ",["l","蔬菜","Vegetables"],", Mushrooms, and ",["l","采集#Foraged Items","foraged items"]," into ",["l","果酱和腌菜","Jellies and Pickles"]," and ",["l","鱼籽","Roe"]," into ",["l","腌鱼籽","Aged Roe"]," or ",["l","鱼籽酱","Caviar"]," in a ",["l","罐头瓶","Preserves Jar"],"."]],["p",["The products produced usually sell for more than the raw input items, so using a Preserves Jar is almost always profitable. Items that lose gold are highlighted in red, and items whose net increase in value is zero are highlighted in orange. Jellies and Pickles are always regular quality, so the profit made from processing items is lowest when using iridium quality and highest when using regular quality items."]],["p",["This table shows the profitability of processing items when the player has chosen the ",["l","耕种#Farming Skill","Tiller Profession"],". To view the profitability for no profession, or the Artisan Profession, use the links at the top of the page."]],["p",["Note that the processing time for a ",["l","罐头瓶","Preserves Jar"]," is always 4000 minutes, with one exception: ",["l","鱼籽","Sturgeon Roe"]," produces ",["l","鱼籽酱","Caviar"]," in 6000 minutes rather than 4000."]],["p",["Productivity (g/minute) = ([Processed Sell Price] - [Input Item Sell Price]) / [Processing time]"]],["p",["Approximate g/day = Productivity (g/minute) * 1600 [1]"]],["p",["Note that you may click on a column header to sort the table by that column, then Shift+Click on a second column to perform a secondary sort."]],["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Input Item"]},{"h":1,"v":["Type"]},{"h":1,"v":["Quality"]},{"h":1,"v":["Input Item Sell Price"]},{"h":1,"v":["Processed Sell Price"]},{"h":1,"v":["Increase in Value (g)"]},{"h":1,"v":["Productivity (g/minute)"]},{"h":1,"v":["Approximate g/day